"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-12-06T20:25:04Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T22:56:09Z","closed_at":"2024-12-06T22:56:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Windows 10.0.22631 - GLES3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4050 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6070) - Intel(R) Core(TM) Ultra 7 155H (22 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nLineEdit doesn't consume keyboard input when focused like it should.\n\nI have a game with a HUD with LineEdit and a camera that moves with WASD in `_unhandled_input`. When I type into the LineEdit the camera still moves because the line edit is not consuming the released events, only the down/pressed events.\n\nWhen an element like LineEdit is focused, it should probably just consume ALL keyboard input like in all other GUI frameworks.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a HUD with a focusable LineEdit\n2. Create a game object/camera with WASD movement in `_unhandled_input`\n3. Run game and type WASD into LineEdit, the player/camera will move on mouse released events\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI gave steps above, it's very simple to repro.","closed_by":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100118/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100118/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}